             FUNCTION OF THE ENVIRONMENT — that makes VSF falsifiable",

  implementation: "~20 lines in operator.rs — update_prototypes(state,
                   weights, prototypes, lr) after the softmax
                   ▪ lr = 0.001 ▪ every 10 ticks (~100s), ¬realtime
                   ▪ hourly μₛ snapshots",
